1. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means keyHunter and all source code, object code, documentation,
configuration, data files, and other materials distributed with this license.

"Licensor" means the copyright holder or holders of the Software.

"Authorized System" means a system, account, network, credential, or dataset
that you own, or for which its owner has given you prior, explicit, written
authorization that identifies the permitted scope, methods, and time period.

"Academic Research Purpose" means studying, analyzing, documenting, or
teaching about the security properties, exposure patterns, or defensive
practices of AI gateway and quota-panel deployments, solely for the benefit
of the owner of an Authorized System or for scholarly publication that does
not disclose live credentials or operational target details.

"Defensive Security Purpose" means identifying, confirming, remediating, or
reporting security exposure solely for the benefit of the owner of an
Authorized System.

